    {
      "uid": "zhcn:461e930597e1412796914631",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对“世纪末霸王”而言，世纪末疗养地有其必要！\n我们现在就出发！前往世纪末温泉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "436c1cdd581a77cc1e88399e89ddceeee7352cd56c0ab104c8ebc00740d5e788",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
