    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65827eab0001e914ea7ecdb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然没有一处温泉是叫那种名字，\n但总之我们出发前去泡温泉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9ab103d310958ff9f538d8f1766692dca6cb23f20038d6bf711763fa43f1963",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
