      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "泡了美肌温泉，\n我这原本就足够美丽的肌肤，\n岂不是要像宝石一样光辉灿烂了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4619a3bc80afa3d6c846b04fb2ab989461e4a56c1a212194481803333f22257",
