      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "等好歌剧的开场白告一段落后，\n我们回到房间，享用了美味的料理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "807173af021d9b5e898dae024601f7f9c945df2de8eea7a052dd1b0b8d953012",
